**, making it different from traditional \"general news\" networks. Its coverage highlights government actions, political debates, elections, policy decisions, social issues, and major national events.\n\nThe peak watching time is **prime time, starting from 7PM to 10PM**.\n\n> \ud83d\udca1 **Tip:** If a stream takes time to load, refresh the page and wait a few seconds for it to begin.",
